        <mxCell id="Hxafv98q6EFaidvqAuXY-3476" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" value="&lt;font&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#4d4d4d&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;PARAMETRI&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#4d4d4d&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ε = 1/4, n = 30, v&lt;sub&gt;max&lt;/sub&gt; = 10&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#4d4d4d&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;b = ε·v&lt;sub&gt;max&lt;/sub&gt;/(2n) = 1/24&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#4d4d4d&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;valori scalati ⌈v/b⌉ = 24·v (v&lt;sub&gt;max&lt;/sub&gt; scalato = 240)&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#4d4d4d&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;b &amp;lt; 1: lo scalamento non riduce i valori, stessa soluzione dell&#39;esatta&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="110" width="330" x="7280" y="850" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Hxafv98q6EFaidvqAuXY-3477" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#4d4d4d&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOTE IMPORTANTI&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#4d4d4d&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#4d4d4d&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;- L&#39;algoritmo approssimato ed esatto per la soluzione del Knapsack Problem non fanno uso di Grafi come strutture dati. Semplici vettori sono sufficienti come input.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#4d4d4d&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#4d4d4d&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;- Se il valore degli oggetti non e&#39; numericamente grande rispetto al numero degli elementi, l&#39;algoritmo approssimato non serve e per qualsivoglia valore di epsilon, esso ritorna una soluzione identica a quello esatto.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#4d4d4d&quot;&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Quindi se n = 30, vmax dovrebbe essere uguale a 2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;30 &lt;/sup&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;o qualcosa di simile....non certo solo 10&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#4d4d4d&quot;&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;Per questo motivo, questo esercizio presenta soluzione esatta e soluzione approssimata identiche per qualsivoglia valore di&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#4d4d4d&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ε.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#4d4d4d&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;Per questo stesso motivo, inoltre, il tempo di esecuzione dell&#39;algoritmo esatto e&#39; molto minore rispetto a quello dell&#39;algoritmo approssimato.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#4d4d4d&quot;&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 9px;&quot;&gt;&lt;sup&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="265" width="690" x="5060" y="968" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Hxafv98q6EFaidvqAuXY-3480" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(22, 23, 26); font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; white-space: nowrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;ε = 1/2 = 0.25&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
