        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Hxafv98q6EFaidvqAuXY-3794" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#4d4d4d&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;NOTE IMPORTANTI&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#4d4d4d&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;- Con valori dell&#39;ordine di 10&lt;sup&gt;5&lt;/sup&gt; la DP esatta sui valori ha n&amp;middot;V = 56.509.770 celle: 7,89 s e circa 460 MB (misure con Knapsack_Exact e Knapsack_Approx su una macchina e un&#39;esecuzione specifiche).&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#4d4d4d&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;- L&#39;approssimato usa 37.740, 67.590 e 134.820 celle (&amp;epsilon; = 0.9, 0.5, 0.25): 5,9 ms, 9,4 ms e 18,7 ms, cioe&#39; circa 1.330.0, 840.0 e 420.0 volte piu&#39; veloce dell&#39;esatto sui valori.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#4d4d4d&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;- Con W = 60 cm la DP sulla capacita&#39; (tabella a fianco, 1.830 celle, 0,11 ms) e&#39; ancora piu&#39; veloce: l&#39;approssimato batte la DP sui valori, non quella sulla capacita&#39;.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#4d4d4d&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;- Gli errori sono piccoli (0.087%% e 0.021%%; zero con &amp;epsilon; = 0.25) perche&#39; i valori di ciascuna categoria sono molto vicini tra loro.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="360" width="770" x="5065.75" y="3623.0699999999997" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Hxafv98q6EFaidvqAuXY-3795" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#4d4d4d&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;T[i][W] = valore massimo ottenibile con i primi i libri e larghezza W [cm] (i = posizione nella Lista Oggetti). DP sulla capacita&#39;: stessa soluzione ottima dell&#39;esatto sui valori, che qui avrebbe 56.509.770 celle.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#4d4d4d&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;grigio = valore 0 &amp;middot; rosso = ricostruzione, cella scura = ottimo T[30][60] = 1.501.380&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="34" width="1400" x="5865.75" y="2652" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
